WEBVTT

00:00:13.410 --> 00:00:15.580
I'm coming with you!

00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:19.370
I appreciate the sentiment,
but I don't want you doing anything dangerous.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:21.120
Try to understand, Kana.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:25.750
Right now, I'm the master thief Hatena.
I can be of help, too.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:29.410
My sweet Kana,
you don't have to be in such a hurry.

00:00:30.870 --> 00:00:35.830
Findabair, look after Kana, okay?

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.910
Jeeves, is everything ready?

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:42.830
Mistress Yumemi is in control of the security.
You may proceed at any time.

00:00:48.870 --> 00:00:50.410
Okay, off I go.

00:00:50.410 --> 00:00:54.040
Be careful. Makoto-<i>chan </i>will be coming soon.

00:00:54.040 --> 00:00:55.750
Right.

00:00:55.750 --> 00:00:59.700
Maeve, the master thief,
is off to collect her prize.

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:07.790
Mama...

00:01:21.330 --> 00:01:24.410
<i>Tell me, do you remember?</i>

00:01:24.410 --> 00:01:28.330
<i>Yes, the wondrous God-given power you have,</i>

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:34.160
<i>like sleight of hand without any tricks?</i>

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:37.950
<i>Tell me, have you already forgotten?</i>

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:41.120
<i>Those dreamlike, heart-shaped</i>

00:01:41.120 --> 00:01:46.500
<i>flower-bouquet-like words of yours?</i>

00:01:46.500 --> 00:01:52.790
<i>I'm sure, I'm sure</i>

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:56.410
<i>this key will open your treasure box</i>

00:01:56.410 --> 00:02:02.660
<i>and let you remember them tonight</i>

00:02:02.660 --> 00:02:05.540
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:02:05.540 --> 00:02:06.830
<i>Watch me now,</i>

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:10.040
<i>I'm gently, quietly going to disappear,</i>

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.950
<i>so find me</i>

00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:13.160
<i>I'm over here</i>

00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:18.290
<i>Our long, long night of secrets is beginning</i>

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:19.580
<i>Come after me</i>

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:24.750
<i>Once you see the twinkle of my tearstains,</i>

00:02:24.750 --> 00:02:27.620
<i>catch me with your voice</i>

00:02:27.620 --> 00:02:32.330
<i>and the magic words only the two of us know</i>

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:46.080
Good morning, Father, Yumemi.

00:02:46.080 --> 00:02:48.620
--Good morning, Kana-<i>sama</i>.
--Good morning, Kana-<i>sama</i>.

00:02:48.620 --> 00:02:50.660
Mm-hmm, morning.

00:02:50.660 --> 00:02:52.750
Kana-<i>sama</i>, would you like something to drink?

00:02:52.750 --> 00:02:55.200
Coffee, black.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:57.040
As you wish.

00:02:57.040 --> 00:02:58.250
Here you are.

00:03:04.790 --> 00:03:06.540
Big sister, some milk.

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:08.830
Th-Thanks.

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:12.410
Kana, do you remember what day today is?

00:03:12.410 --> 00:03:14.580
Of course I do, Father.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.830
It's the day my good friend
Makoto-<i>chan </i>is coming.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:21.910
We haven't seen each
other in years. I can't wait.

00:03:24.830 --> 00:03:28.040
We'll be together again soon, Makoto-<i>chan</i>.

00:03:29.370 --> 00:03:33.120
I don't really remember Makoto.
I'm a little anxious.

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:37.120
It's all right. Makoto-<i>chan</i>
has always been a good egg.

00:03:37.120 --> 00:03:40.500
Now if only Mother were here,
things would be perfect.

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:45.620
I wonder where Mother could be.

00:03:45.620 --> 00:03:49.500
She said she would be back
for the entrance ceremony.

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:57.120
Where am I?

00:03:57.120 --> 00:04:00.790
Oh, no. I'm going to be
late for the time we set.

00:04:03.950 --> 00:04:05.330
What's the matter?

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:10.370
My mama isn't here. Where is Nana's mama?

00:04:10.370 --> 00:04:14.330
Oh, sorry about that, but I'm lost myself.

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:19.200
I-It's all right. I'm sure your
mother is looking for you, too.

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.200
Mama is coming?

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:26.290
Mm-hmm. Hey, I have an idea!
Nana-<i>chan</i>, watch this!

00:04:26.290 --> 00:04:28.750
Wah! What's that?

00:04:28.750 --> 00:04:31.410
This is my magic wand.

00:04:31.410 --> 00:04:32.750
Magic?

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:33.750
Yes!

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.370
Amazing!

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:38.830
I summon you, sweet power.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:41.540
There!

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:45.700
Candy!

00:04:47.160 --> 00:04:48.620
Nana!

00:04:48.620 --> 00:04:49.870
Mama!

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:52.120
"Hoshisato"

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:02.910
We have been expecting you,
Shiranui Makoto-<i>sama</i>.

00:05:02.910 --> 00:05:04.870
A-A maid?

00:05:04.870 --> 00:05:09.040
My name is Sakurai Ema,
and I serve as the family's maid.

00:05:09.040 --> 00:05:14.410
Sh-Sh-Shiranui Makoto.
It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:05:14.410 --> 00:05:17.580
This way. The master is expecting you.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:22.290
It is quite bold of you
to be late on your first day.

00:05:22.290 --> 00:05:23.910
Sorry.

00:05:24.950 --> 00:05:28.700
Such a fine look of confoundedness.
Quite endearing.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:31.660
Ema, stop teasing our guest.

00:05:31.660 --> 00:05:33.580
I beg your pardon.

00:05:38.830 --> 00:05:41.660
I serve as the family butler.

00:05:41.660 --> 00:05:44.120
My name is Jeeves Wodehouse.

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:46.410
I-It is a pleasure to meet you.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.700
Makoto-<i>sama</i>, you must be an <i>uke</i>.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.910
Huh?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:56.410
Makoto!

00:05:56.410 --> 00:05:57.250
Huh?

00:05:57.250 --> 00:06:00.200
Welcome, Makoto! It's been so long!

00:06:00.200 --> 00:06:02.160
I've missed you!

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.750
Huh? Makoto?

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:12.620
Y-Yes?

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:14.870
Have you forgotten who I am?

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:16.620
Huh?

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:18.450
Is that you, Hatena?

00:06:18.450 --> 00:06:20.080
Mm-hmm, that's right.

00:06:20.080 --> 00:06:22.660
"Ka" as in <i>kajitsu </i>[fruit] and
"na" as in <i>nanoha </i>[green vegetables], "Kana."

00:06:22.660 --> 00:06:24.120
Also read as "Hatena."

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:29.120
I-I'm stunned. You've gotten so pretty,
I barely recognized you.

00:06:29.120 --> 00:06:32.540
Ha, same old outburst. It really is you, Hatena.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:36.160
I don't actually like it when
people call me "Hatena,"

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.410
but you're a special case, Makoto.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:41.290
It's been too long. I'm glad to see you.

00:06:41.290 --> 00:06:43.870
Me, too! I can't believe you're really here!

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.910
Thanks for remembering our promise.

00:06:45.910 --> 00:06:48.500
I have heard much about you from Mistress Kana.

00:06:48.500 --> 00:06:51.200
Something about being Mistress Kana's prince?

00:06:51.200 --> 00:06:52.620
--Huh?
--Ema-<i>san</i>!

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:56.750
I-It's not like that. Remember, when
we were attacked by that stray dog,

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:59.200
you stepped up and saved me, right?

00:06:59.200 --> 00:07:02.040
Just like a prince from a picture book.

00:07:02.040 --> 00:07:05.040
Gah! What am I even talking about?!

00:07:07.330 --> 00:07:10.370
I have to say, though,
Makoto, you've become so rugged looking.

00:07:10.370 --> 00:07:12.040
You kind of look more like a boy.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.000
More like a boy?

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:18.160
Your hair is still short, and you wear
the same boyish clothes as ever.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:20.450
You could put on a cute outfit once in a while.

00:07:20.450 --> 00:07:23.540
If I had to say, "cute" really isn't my...

00:07:23.540 --> 00:07:25.200
You still refer to yourself as "boku," too.

00:07:25.200 --> 00:07:26.750
Going for a boyish character?

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:30.450
That does kind of suit you, though.
Oh, I get it!

00:07:30.450 --> 00:07:33.750
You want to be just like Papa,
so you wear guys' clothes, is that it?

00:07:34.790 --> 00:07:37.620
Mistress, a moment, if I may?

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.200
Makoto-<i>sama </i>is...

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:48.160
What are you talking about?
Please don't say things like that!

00:07:48.160 --> 00:07:53.080
It appears I have little choice.
Mistress, Makoto-<i>sama</i>, please sit over here.

00:07:53.080 --> 00:07:54.620
I apologize in advance.

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:57.500
What for? What are you doing?

00:07:57.500 --> 00:08:00.200
Come on... Huh?

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:03.660
Nothing... Huh? No way...

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.200
Who are you?!

00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.250
I'm Makoto.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:10.540
I-It can't be...!

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.950
No!

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:23.370
Things sure are lively in here.
Are you celebrating your reunion?

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:24.910
Mamoru-<i>ojisan</i>!

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:26.790
Papa, bad news!

00:08:26.790 --> 00:08:30.580
What has you in such a lather, my precious?

00:08:30.580 --> 00:08:34.040
Makoto has turned into a boy!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:40.540
Kana, you say the silliest things.
Makoto-<i>kun </i>was born a boy.

00:08:41.540 --> 00:08:42.830
No way...

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:52.160
That glimmer in your eye--young man,
you're full of ambition, aren't you?

00:08:52.160 --> 00:08:55.580
Y-Yes! I've come to town, just like we agreed.

00:08:55.580 --> 00:08:57.950
Please teach me your magic!

00:08:57.950 --> 00:09:00.410
Conjuring tricks! Sleight of hand! Magic!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:03.250
It goes by many names,
but its true nature is the same--

00:09:03.250 --> 00:09:06.910
to amaze the watcher, and
make them think they're dreaming!

00:09:06.910 --> 00:09:10.790
A magician revealing his secrets is equal
to entrusting his life with someone.

00:09:10.790 --> 00:09:12.250
Do you understand, Makoto-<i>kun</i>?

00:09:12.250 --> 00:09:15.160
Yes! I will keep your secrets
even if it means my life!

00:09:15.160 --> 00:09:17.450
For the sake of the smiles
of those who watch me!

00:09:17.450 --> 00:09:20.290
Good answer. I accept you as my apprentice.

00:09:20.290 --> 00:09:22.700
From now on, you may call me "Master."

00:09:22.700 --> 00:09:25.330
Yes, Master! I look forward to working with you!

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:30.330
Now that you'll be living in this house,
think of us as your family.

00:09:30.330 --> 00:09:32.410
Just a minute!

00:09:32.410 --> 00:09:34.910
Is he seriously going to be living here?!

00:09:34.910 --> 00:09:37.540
You were tickled pink when
you agreed to this, weren't you?

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.950
But Makoto is a boy!

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:41.120
Um, Hatena...

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:43.870
Don't call me "Hatena"! My name is Kana!

00:09:43.870 --> 00:09:45.160
O-Okay, Kana...

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:46.580
And no omitting honorifics, either!

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:51.790
K-Kana-<i>chan</i>, I came to town because
I really want to be a magician. So...

00:09:51.790 --> 00:09:54.120
That has nothing to do with this.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:09:57.160
Master, it is just about time.

00:09:57.160 --> 00:10:00.250
Oh. Jeeves, I'll let you take it from here.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:02.410
Um, where are you going?

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.830
As it happens, I have to go overseas.

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:09.450
Kana, Yumemi, it's for work.
You understand, right?

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:12.200
Hold on! Take me with you, then!

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:15.250
Kana, you have your
entrance ceremony, don't you?

00:10:15.250 --> 00:10:18.120
R-Right! What about my entrance ceremony?

00:10:18.120 --> 00:10:21.000
I'm sorry, Kana. It's truly a shame.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:23.500
But Makoto-<i>kun </i>is here.
You won't be alone, right?

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:25.830
That's the problem!

00:10:25.830 --> 00:10:27.120
All right, then...

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:34.620
I will see you all again in one month. <i>Adiós!</i>

00:10:34.620 --> 00:10:35.450
Papa...

00:10:35.450 --> 00:10:38.200
Levitation magic! I mean, illusion!

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:42.750
I have no idea how it's done!
That's Hoshisato Mamoru for you!

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:45.290
Forgive the delayed introduction, Makoto-<i>sama</i>.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:48.700
This is the Hoshisato family's
younger daughter, Yumemi-<i>sama</i>.

00:10:48.700 --> 00:10:52.250
We met when you were little,
but you don't remember me, do you?

00:10:54.370 --> 00:10:56.580
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>, watch this.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.750
Ho, he is quite deft.

00:11:02.750 --> 00:11:05.120
I summon you, crimson power.

00:11:08.950 --> 00:11:10.410
Catch.

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:14.540
I can keep it?

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:19.950
Mm-hmm. A token of our new friendship.
Nice to know you, Yumemi-<i>chan</i>.

00:11:19.950 --> 00:11:21.830
Nice to know you.

00:11:21.830 --> 00:11:24.700
How grand to see Mistress Yumemi smiling.

00:11:24.700 --> 00:11:28.000
Hmm. I may be somewhat upset by this.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:32.500
There's no way he can live here!

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:35.290
Jeeves-<i>san</i>, please do something about this!

00:11:35.290 --> 00:11:38.000
You are in the wrong about this, Mistress.

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:42.870
To drive someone's child out into
the streets before the entrance ceremony

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:44.700
would disgrace the Hoshisato family name.

00:11:44.700 --> 00:11:49.080
We should keep him here with
us until Mamoru-<i>sama </i>returns.

00:11:49.080 --> 00:11:51.450
Th-That's true.

00:11:51.450 --> 00:11:55.540
He can stay until we can get in touch
with either Father or Mother.

00:11:55.540 --> 00:11:58.830
Not as someone living here,
but as a guest, understand?

00:11:58.830 --> 00:12:02.450
I believe that strikes a good compromise.

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:03.500
Hatena, thanks--

00:12:03.500 --> 00:12:05.540
I said don't call me "Hatena"!

00:12:05.540 --> 00:12:06.750
Geez!

00:12:11.290 --> 00:12:13.700
Everything you need should be there.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:16.450
However, the room has
been in use as a storeroom.

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:19.500
It's fine. Thank you very much.

00:12:24.120 --> 00:12:25.200
Ho,

00:12:25.200 --> 00:12:28.790
that certainly was quick. I am impressed.

00:12:28.790 --> 00:12:31.080
I'm pretty handy when it comes to cleaning.

00:12:31.080 --> 00:12:34.120
I will leave your sheets here.

00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:36.120
Thank you very much.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:38.660
This will prove useful.

00:12:38.660 --> 00:12:41.580
Hmm, I can see the floor in here. Amazing.

00:12:41.580 --> 00:12:44.200
Th-This isn't any big deal, is it?

00:12:44.200 --> 00:12:46.660
I am impressed that you
did this all by yourself.

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:48.750
Ho, and the Artifacts, as well.

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:50.040
Artifacts?

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:52.870
I mean those small objects there.

00:12:52.870 --> 00:12:54.700
Sorry, I just helped myself.

00:12:54.700 --> 00:12:58.370
Not at all. You arranged
them nicely. Outstanding.

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:00.370
I sorted them by type, and...

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:07.540
Ah! I-I'm sorry!
Please let me pay for it, if I can!

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:08.660
It's okay.

00:13:08.660 --> 00:13:09.870
That thing never worked anyway--

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:11.700
Big sister...

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:17.120
This just will not do.
That was a substantially precious item.

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:19.830
U-Um, what can I do?

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.540
Hmm... Tell me, Ema, what do you propose?

00:13:23.540 --> 00:13:27.660
What if we put Makoto-<i>sama</i>
to work here at the mansion?

00:13:27.660 --> 00:13:31.830
The mansion is understaffed,
so what if he pays for the broken item

00:13:31.830 --> 00:13:35.120
from the money he earns as a butler-in-training?

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:38.580
I'll do it! Please put me to work!

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.370
A young butler. This will work.

00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:44.580
Hold on, Ema-<i>san</i>! Makoto will be leaving soon.

00:13:44.580 --> 00:13:45.830
I second that proposal.

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.330
You, too, Yumemi?

00:13:47.330 --> 00:13:52.290
Then that settles it.
As of today, Makoto-<i>sama </i>is my co-worker.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.040
Eh?!

00:13:54.040 --> 00:13:57.410
Very well, Makoto-<i>sama</i>,
I did not expect things to turn out this way,

00:13:57.410 --> 00:13:59.910
but I do look forward to working with you.

00:13:59.910 --> 00:14:01.290
Right!

00:14:03.160 --> 00:14:06.620
I wonder if you were not a bit too heavy handed.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:09.370
You do not get it, do you?

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.660
The more severe the first encounter is,
and the harsher the circumstances,

00:14:12.660 --> 00:14:16.410
the more intense any
further developments will be.

00:14:16.410 --> 00:14:21.000
Remember that Mistress Kana
referred to Makoto-<i>sama </i>as a prince.

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:23.750
With just a little nudge,
it'll be a cinch--or rather,

00:14:23.750 --> 00:14:25.950
their relationship will improve with ease.

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:28.870
While we watch their tense,
exhilarating experiences living together,

00:14:28.870 --> 00:14:31.080
we can offer just enough reinforcement--

00:14:31.080 --> 00:14:34.200
or rather, support, at just the right times.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:37.120
Well, within reason.

00:14:37.120 --> 00:14:39.500
Aw, man!

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:42.580
I said it in the heat of the moment,
but no way! There's no way!

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:45.290
I cannot live under the same roof as a boy!

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:48.450
This is all Papa's fault.

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:53.250
Mama, I'm going through all this trouble.
Why don't you call us?

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:04.120
This place is like a maze. Is it in here?

00:15:07.250 --> 00:15:08.750
I-I'm sorry!

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:17.950
No! Makoto, you dummy! You sicko!

00:15:17.950 --> 00:15:19.870
What was that?

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:23.660
Makoto-<i>sama</i>, please be
careful when using the bath.

00:15:23.660 --> 00:15:26.750
The mistress often uses this bathroom.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:29.660
You might have said something sooner.

00:15:29.660 --> 00:15:32.500
He saw me! He saw me! He saw me!
He saw me! He saw me! He saw me!

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:34.410
He definitely saw me!

00:15:35.410 --> 00:15:40.450
I'm going to make absolutely
sure that he goes away!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.950
M-Makoto...

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:47.080
Hatena, it's all right.

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.370
Why, you...!

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.250
Makoto, are you hurt?

00:15:55.250 --> 00:15:57.370
Mm-mm, no problem.

00:15:58.410 --> 00:16:01.160
You broke your wand, huh?

00:16:01.160 --> 00:16:03.830
As long as you're safe, Hatena,
that's all that matters.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:06.950
Makoto...

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:10.290
Thank you. You're like my prince, huh?

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:12.830
You're going to make me blush.

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:15.700
Makoto, you're going to be like my papa, right?

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:17.410
Mm-hmm, a m-magi--

00:16:17.410 --> 00:16:18.450
Magician.

00:16:18.450 --> 00:16:22.200
Yeah, that. He was so cool at that show earlier.

00:16:22.200 --> 00:16:26.120
And Maeve-<i>san</i>, your mama, was
up there on the stage with him.

00:16:26.120 --> 00:16:28.830
I want to be just like Mama, too!

00:16:28.830 --> 00:16:32.580
Right. So, Hatena, when
you've become like Maeve-<i>san</i>,

00:16:32.580 --> 00:16:34.700
will you go up on the stage with me?

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:35.870
Mm-hmm!

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:39.410
Then, Makoto, you can be my partner!

00:16:39.410 --> 00:16:43.750
You got it. I'll be your partner, Hatena.

00:16:43.750 --> 00:16:45.500
That's a promise!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:57.870
You yell out when the maid
comes to wake you in the morning?

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:01.290
People like that deserve a good scolding.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:02.750
I'm sorry.

00:17:02.750 --> 00:17:05.000
All right, please change into these clothes.

00:17:05.910 --> 00:17:10.750
G-Good morning... Hate--
Kana-<i>chan</i>, and you, too, Jeeves-<i>san</i>.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.870
Good morning. That looks good on you.

00:17:13.870 --> 00:17:19.250
Good morning. So you really are going
through with being a butler-in-training.

00:17:19.250 --> 00:17:21.700
Makoto-<i>sama</i>, over here.

00:17:21.700 --> 00:17:24.120
You need to know your way around the mansion.

00:17:24.120 --> 00:17:27.450
I'm likely to get lost in this place.

00:17:27.450 --> 00:17:29.580
There are also a number
of rooms in the basement,

00:17:29.580 --> 00:17:32.830
as well as the tool shed
and smokehouse in the yard.

00:17:32.830 --> 00:17:37.500
You must learn them all,
or you will be a failure as a butler.

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:42.040
There is one last important thing to
be aware of while working in the mansion.

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:44.120
Okay.

00:17:44.120 --> 00:17:46.620
Never act surprised, no matter what happens.

00:17:46.620 --> 00:17:47.580
Huh?

00:17:47.580 --> 00:17:51.700
This mansion, in which
Maeve-<i>sama</i>'s ancestors lived,

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:54.080
was moved here from overseas,

00:17:54.080 --> 00:17:57.250
and is said to have been built
many hundreds of years ago.

00:17:57.250 --> 00:18:01.370
Old buildings are... You know?

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:04.410
H-Haunted, you mean?

00:18:04.410 --> 00:18:09.910
No, I do not mean ghosts.
Whose property is this mansion again?

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:13.950
The magicians of the century,
Hoshisato Mamoru and his partner, Maeve-<i>san</i>!

00:18:13.950 --> 00:18:18.790
Yes. Not even I know where all
of Mamoru-<i>sama</i>'s tricks are set up.

00:18:18.790 --> 00:18:21.330
He is, after all, quite mischievous.

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.290
I-I understand.

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:27.500
That is all. Please take
a stroll around outside now.

00:18:27.500 --> 00:18:30.040
You will often be asked to run errands.

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:33.250
Kana-<i>sama</i>, would you
please show him around the city?

00:18:33.250 --> 00:18:34.200
Huh?!

00:18:34.200 --> 00:18:36.450
Wh-Why should <i>I </i>have to?!

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:39.120
Because you have the least to do.

00:18:40.910 --> 00:18:42.870
This is an amazing mansion.

00:18:42.870 --> 00:18:47.250
Magic 101 is to hide that which can't be hidden.

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:48.250
That makes sense.

00:18:48.250 --> 00:18:52.290
Come on, don't fall behind,
or you might get lost again.

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:54.200
M-Mm-hmm.

00:18:54.200 --> 00:18:57.040
Ah! The magician!

00:18:57.040 --> 00:18:57.870
Oh, my.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.000
Hello.

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:00.450
Thank you for what you did yesterday.

00:19:00.450 --> 00:19:01.290
Huh?

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:05.120
He helped out my daughter
Nana when she got lost yesterday.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:08.120
It looks like you finally
got where you were going, though.

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:10.500
Oh, yes, luckily enough.

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:16.200
Say, are you two on a date?

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:18.410
N-No, we aren't!

00:19:18.410 --> 00:19:20.580
See you later!

00:19:20.580 --> 00:19:23.330
You could have told me
why you were late yesterday.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:27.200
No, I shouldn't have
gotten lost in the first place.

00:19:28.540 --> 00:19:32.330
That part about him is
the same as it's always been.

00:19:32.330 --> 00:19:33.410
Hm? Hatena?

00:19:33.410 --> 00:19:36.040
I'm not Hatena! I'm Kana!

00:19:36.040 --> 00:19:37.000
We're back!

00:19:37.000 --> 00:19:38.830
Welcome home.

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:42.450
How was your date?

00:19:42.450 --> 00:19:44.500
D--?! Ema-<i>san</i>, not you, too!

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:45.830
I was joking.

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:48.910
Ah, Yumemi-<i>chan</i>.

00:19:48.910 --> 00:19:50.040
Morning.

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:52.700
Oh, Yumemi, it's noon already.

00:19:52.700 --> 00:19:54.660
I have lots to do.

00:19:54.660 --> 00:19:56.290
Like what?

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:57.620
Games and stuff.

00:19:57.620 --> 00:20:00.580
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>, you like playing games?

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:04.700
I do. Makoto-<i>niisama</i>,
would you play with me sometime?

00:20:04.700 --> 00:20:06.370
Mm-hmm, sure.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:09.830
This is unusual--Yumemi
actually inviting someone else.

00:20:09.830 --> 00:20:11.700
Upset indeed.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:15.750
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>, I'd like to see
that thing from yesterday again.

00:20:15.750 --> 00:20:17.830
Yesterday? Oh...

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:18.870
Okay.

00:20:19.870 --> 00:20:20.910
Here.

00:20:20.910 --> 00:20:22.870
Let me see that!

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:25.000
--Whoa, hey!
--Let me just have a look!

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:28.080
Kana-<i>sama</i>, you are getting
too close to Makoto-<i>sama</i>.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.450
Oh, this is one I had bought for me

00:20:32.450 --> 00:20:34.700
at a nearby toy store
after Master's performance.

00:20:34.700 --> 00:20:36.500
I'd like to see it. May I?

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:37.660
Go ahead.

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:47.080
It smells like Mother.

00:20:47.080 --> 00:20:49.250
Huh? What do you mean?

00:20:49.250 --> 00:20:52.830
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>, did our mama
make this wand for you?

00:20:52.830 --> 00:20:56.910
Maeve-<i>san </i>once repaired
the wand for me after it had been broken.

00:20:56.910 --> 00:21:00.870
You remember that, right?
When you were attacked by that stray dog?

00:21:00.870 --> 00:21:02.870
I-I remember...

00:21:02.870 --> 00:21:04.290
Here.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:09.410
Well?

00:21:09.410 --> 00:21:11.580
Everything is fine.

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:13.040
How about it?

00:21:13.040 --> 00:21:16.580
It was there. It had Mother's symbol on it.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.080
Then we have to get that wand back.

00:21:19.080 --> 00:21:23.160
Anyone that Mother entrusted
with an Artifact is a good person.

00:21:23.160 --> 00:21:27.200
Makoto-<i>niisama </i>is taking
very good care of that wand.

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:31.040
Even so, we can't just ignore
one of Mother's Artifacts!

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:34.330
I'm going to help Mama out!

00:22:06.790 --> 00:22:11.200
Hatena, the master thief,
is off to collect her prize.

00:22:12.450 --> 00:22:18.250
<i>My path now begins</i>

00:22:18.250 --> 00:22:26.620
<i>I've unleashed the hidden light of one future</i>

00:22:30.330 --> 00:22:33.000
<i>I've been on the hunt</i>

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:37.040
<i>to find my furthest dreams</i>

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.200
<i>I want to shine even brighter</i>

00:22:40.200 --> 00:22:45.330
<i>The "someday" that my former self prayed for</i>

00:22:45.330 --> 00:22:50.500
<i>is still far away, but I'll catch up</i>

00:22:50.500 --> 00:22:55.500
<i>"Miracle" is such an embarrassingly vague word</i>

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:00.660
<i>My timeframe has neither forever nor a moment</i>

00:23:00.660 --> 00:23:07.910
<i>I move forward one step at a time to my voice</i>

00:23:07.910 --> 00:23:11.700
<i>No matter what awaits me</i>

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:13.040
<i>beyond this pain</i>

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:15.290
<i>I'll once again, yes once again</i>

00:23:15.290 --> 00:23:18.040
<i>leap up and shine</i>

00:23:18.040 --> 00:23:21.870
<i>Yeah, I'll put into words</i>

00:23:21.870 --> 00:23:23.410
<i>the view laid out before me</i>

00:23:23.410 --> 00:23:26.700
<i>and let it ring out dozens,</i>

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:30.370
<i>even hundreds of times</i>

00:23:30.370 --> 00:23:34.660
<i>What color do you suppose love is?</i>

00:23:34.660 --> 00:23:40.330
<i>I've unleashed my hidden light</i>

00:23:42.040 --> 00:23:44.660
"What was for dinner last night?"

00:23:45.330 --> 00:23:51.950
"Hatena"

00:23:51.950 --> 00:24:01.870
"See you next time!"
